+The `vets` cache is keyed by method arguments alone, not by the method that produced the value. `VetRepository.findAll()` and `VetRepository.findAll(Pageable)` coexist in it because their arguments differ; a second no-argument method sharing that cache name would collide with the first and return a value of the wrong type. `SpecialtyRepository` is therefore uncached.
